    questFailed: The fool is waiting for you at the edge of the forest. Once she
      sees you empty pawed, she storms offs, kicking a nearby rock and nearly stubbing
      her toe. You tilt your head but move on.
    questWon: The fool is waiting for you at the edge of the forest. When she sees
      the bottles, she takes a swing from one before pulling you into a spontaneous
      cuddle session. You are covered in red kisses but you're just glad the fool
      was so happy to see you.
